      "title": "Saudi Tabreed Secures 10-Year Contract Extension with KAFD",
      "summary": "Saudi Tabreed has consolidated its leadership position through a 10-year contract extension with King Abdullah Financial District (KAFD) for the operation and maintenance of two district cooling plants with a total capacity of 100,000 TR.",
